<div class="container py-5">
    <h1>About ServeSkill Academy</h1>
    <p class="lead">ServeSkill Academy is a free, web-based learning platform built to raise the standard of restaurant and hospitality service across Nepal.</p>
    <p>We work with local hospitality educators to publish short, practical courses covering front office operations, food &amp; beverage service, housekeeping, and culinary basics — all accessible from a phone or a desktop, with no cost to the learner.</p>
    <h5 class="mt-4">Our Mission</h5>
    <p>To make consistent, high-quality hospitality training accessible to every worker in the industry, regardless of their access to formal training programs.</p>
</div>
